WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.800
Modulo’s advanced annual increase methodology starts with length-of-stay
estimates to predict turnover by service line.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:12.000
As residents transition, the model blends new Street Rates
with planned in-house increases, quarter by quarter.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
It solves both levers together so the combined rate and revenue
growth path reaches the target.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.300
All else equal, the plan hits it.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:29.500
When the new year begins, dynamic pricing takes over—always testing
the next move, and always betting that every decision will be revenue accretive.